OL,3,GNEWSAPolice begin inquiry into
OL,4,Awork-from-home 'spoofing'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice in Northern Ireland are
OL,7,Finvestigating 20 of their officers,
OL,8,Fstaff and contractors who are suspected
OL,9,Fof "productivity spoofing," Deputy
OL,10,FChief Constable Bobby Singleton has
OL,11,Fsaid.
OL,13,FIn a letter to Policing Board members,
OL,14,FSingleton said Operation Akarpos has
OL,15,Fbeen launched to guard against abuse of
OL,16,Fremote working and to ensure the
OL,17,Fproductivity of staff.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,416,410,260,120,0,100
