OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAPolice begin inquiry into
OL,4,Awork-from-home 'spoofing'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Anti-Corruption Unit (ACU), which
OL,7,Fis carrying out the inquiry, has found
OL,8,F"no systemic abuse of home working by
OL,9,FPolice Service of Northern Ireland
OL,10,F(PSNI) officers and staff".
OL,12,FSingleton said the
OL,13,F"activity/productivity spoofing" can
OL,14,Finclude taking steps to make users
OL,15,Fappears active when they are away from
OL,16,Ftheir laptops.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
